The Tribunal has also awarded a sum of Rs.10,000/- for transportation charges; Rs.15,000/- for extra-nourishment charges; Rs.5,200/- for attender charges during treatment and Rs.18,000/- towards attender charges after the treatment for three months;
Rs.19,500/- for loss of income for three months; Rs.50,000/- for pain and sufferings and Rs.5,000/- for loss of articles.
